+# PUT /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/review-assign — a steward assigns a REVIEW claim's review to a user. Body
+# {"user":"<user>"}. The claim shows the user from then on (kept after it leaves REVIEW) and REVIEW_ASSIGNED is
+# written. Refused with 422 for anyone else, any other status, or a blank user; nothing is stored. 404 for a claim
+# not on the sheet.
